        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "I'm a hardworking, curious and dedicated person who thrives on being challenged to grow — strong technical knowledge paired with collaborative instincts, and the project management experience to step into a leadership role when one is needed.",
          "spans": [
            {
              "start": 69,
              "end": 87,
              "type": "em"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "intro_text_2": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "I completed my BSc IT at North-West University and am now pursuing Honours in Computer Science at the University of Pretoria, focused on machine learning, data science and data engineering.",
