            {
              "start": 25,
              "end": 46,
              "type": "strong"
            },
            {
              "start": 102,
              "end": 124,
              "type": "strong"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Day to day that means Python, SQL, Java and JavaScript, React and Node on the front end, and AWS underneath — Lambda, RDS, EC2 and S3. Away from the desk: automobiles, emerging tech, video games, and time with family and friends.",
